      "id": "claim_19b11b6e8e424b509aeb2fbbac1e0361",
      "statement": "GPT.__init__ runs under the meta device and only defines shapes; all real values including the non-persistent rotary buffers are produced by init_weights(), so model construction follows GPT(config) -> to_empty(device) -> init_weights(), and build_model calls init_weights before load_state_dict for that reason.",
