      "id": "claim_28a13e33421d477cadd8f6f4754b81ac",
      "statement": "The custom Linear casts its weight to the input dtype at every forward call, replacing autocast, and num_matmul_params counts matmul parameters structurally as the sum over Linear modules, so FLOP estimates depend on all matmuls going through this class.",
