      "id": "claim_1e755849e6214d4084eb58c92adde46c",
      "statement": "Attention applies rotary embeddings (rotating by -theta for checkpoint compatibility), QK norm, a 1.2x scale on both q and k, and on alternating layers selected by has_ve adds a token value embedding into v through a per-KV-head sigmoid gate in (0, 3) computed from the first 12 input channels.",
