      "statement": "init_weights defines the whole initialisation scheme (wte std 0.8, lm_head std 0.001, uniform bound sqrt(3)/sqrt(n_embd) for input matrices with c_fc at 0.4x, zero output projections, depth-decaying lambda schedules) and then casts wte and value embeddings to COMPUTE_DTYPE unless it is float16.",
