      "statement": "The model owns the cost-accounting helpers used by training and benchmarking: estimate_flops (6 * matmul params plus window-capped attention), decode/prefill FLOP estimates, KV-cache bytes per token and per-step read bytes, and num_scaling_params which returns per-group counts asserted to sum to the total.",
