      "statement": "setup_optimizer partitions all parameters into AdamW groups (lm_head, wte, value embeddings, resid, x0, smear/backout scalars) with LRs scaled by (n_embd/768)^-0.5 and Muon groups formed per distinct matrix shape, asserts full coverage, and returns a MuonAdamW with initial_lr recorded per group.",
